  isBadDecision: 0
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    text: 'This blue iris... probably that of the dyer, a man and an admirable father.
      But above all, a very dear friend. '
  - speaker: 1
    text: He was so brave when that beast showed up.
  - speaker: 0
    text: 'But where did this creature come from? '
  - speaker: 1
    text: She was simply attracted by the food from our campsite, she was hungry...
      And we were a good source of nutrients, I guess.
